# FIXED, DEFECT 2143, 2026-10-19, lane lane-witnessed-seed (panel 225's R1,
# route E; the critic's S1), and 2026-10-25, M-rechecked-issues (its other
# half).
#
# SYMPTOM: `narrow`'s parameter was told alone at exit 1; `K_NONE` and
# `K_DIV`, of `fixedbugs2143/vals`, whose unit clang refused too, on the
# next build.
#
# CAUSE: beside a refusal the probe asked only the FIRST refused unit again,
# and the round's verdict was that unit's alone (`cli/assemble.hero`'s
# `per_module`).
#
# FIX: every refused unit is asked, one at a time, so `K_DIV` is told here
# (2026-10-19); and every refused unit's own refusal is read for whose it
# is, so `K_NONE` is told here too (`cli/refused_units.hero`, 2026-10-25).
use fixedbugs2143/vals

extern "fixedbugs-2128-narrow.h"
    function narrow(x: i64) -> i32  #~ ffi_parameter_type

function main()
    print(to_i64(narrow(x: 3)).must() + vals.got())
